      "title": "Pattern 1: In-Network Agent",
      "items": [
        "External LLM never initiates inbound connections into corporate datacenter",
        "Agent process prompts LLM outbound via HTTPS and calls MCP tools locally over stdio",
        "Zero firewall pinholes or public gateway exposures required"
      ]
